/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":105,"digest":"sha256:ee54d361e335bc7b154b5719d3b9adac0da75855feece7ac75d631cefe44a85e","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-22T10:06:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T10:06:23Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.2.18/SHA256SUMS"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/assets/581112465","id":581112465,"node_id":"RA_kwDOUZPJh84ioxKR","name":"UPDATE.zh-CN.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"yinsn","id":102125674,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhZQag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102125674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn","html_url":"https://github.com/yinsn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":1806,"digest":"sha256:0b3e516aecc563814605bfb85a9c0c12a625851fff2a7939046f45f250758d78","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-22T10:06:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T10:06:23Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.2.18/UPDATE.zh-CN.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/tarball/v0.2.18","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/zipball/v0.2.18","body":"# 释手 0.2.18 · Option 英语听写\n\n构建：20260922-100130（UTC）\n\n## 本次改动\n\n- **默认单按 Option 输出标准英语**：左右 Option 均可，按下并松开后开始录音，说完再按一下结束。可以说中文、英文或中英混合，自动整理成自然、语法正确的英语并粘贴。\n- **普通听写继续保留**：原快捷键和文字整理模式照常使用。Option 与其他按键或鼠标组合使用时不触发；若原快捷键已占用右 Option，英语听写使用左 Option。录音开始时确定输出语言，结束按键不会切换语言。可在「设置 → 快捷键」关闭英语听写。\n- **全程本地**：复用已有 Qwen 模型，无需新增模型。规则模式下按需加载，用完释放；智能整理模式下复用已加载模型。首次转换可能稍慢。\n- **可核对、可恢复**：历史记录标注「标准英语」并保留识别原文。转换失败或生成不完整时显示错误并保存原文，不粘贴中文回退；英语连续听写使用英文句间标点，沿用既有去句末标点和末尾空白的习惯。\n\n模型翻译仍可能有误，重要内容请对照原文核对。本次轻量更新复用本机模型，个人词典、历史与已有设置保留。\n\n## 更新方法\n\n- **0.2.2 或更新版本**：打开「设置 → 关于释手 → 检查更新 → 下载并更新」。\n- **0.2.1 或更早版本**：下载本次轻量更新包，退出释手，运行包内的 `FreeJotUpdater.app`，选择原来的完整离线应用，可直接升级到 0.2.18。\n- **新 Mac 首次安装**：按[完整安装指南](https://yinsn.github.io/FreeJot-Updates/INSTALL.md)安装含模型的 0.2.4 完整包，再在应用内更新到 0.2.18。\n\n完成后在「关于释手」核对版本与构建号。\n"}